630
45:27.163 --> 45:30.499
You always talk to your boyfriend on the phone every time I smoke.

631
45:30.583 --> 45:32.376
Seriously.

632
45:32.460 --> 45:34.962
There's no privacy in this house.

633
45:35.046 --> 45:36.714
You're not the only one who's had a boyfriend.

634
45:36.797 --> 45:37.923
I've been there too.

635
45:38.007 --> 45:39.300
It's not a big deal.

636
45:39.800 --> 45:41.344
I thought you got married through a blind date.

637
45:41.427 --> 45:43.095
Well, I did get married through a blind date.

638
45:43.512 --> 45:44.638
But I was in love

639
45:45.389 --> 45:46.724
with someone else.

640
45:48.017 --> 45:49.769
I should've married him.

641
45:52.188 --> 45:54.398
As a daughter of the Gongs

642
45:54.940 --> 45:58.444
and as someone who's lived just a little longer than you

643
45:58.944 --> 45:59.945
do you want a piece of advice?

644
46:01.155 --> 46:02.239
What is it?

645
46:03.157 --> 46:04.283
We need...

646
46:07.328 --> 46:08.662
to get crazy.

647
46:09.080 --> 46:11.999
Have you ever done anything crazy in your life before?

648
46:15.252 --> 46:16.504
- Like sleeping out? - Sleeping...

649
46:17.671 --> 46:19.673
Not that.

650
46:19.757 --> 46:22.593
Something so crazy that you've never even thought about before.

651
46:25.596 --> 46:27.390
- What about you? - Me?

652
46:29.350 --> 46:30.559
I have, obviously.

653
46:36.399 --> 46:37.483
I got divorced.

654
46:40.528 --> 46:43.489
It was the craziest thing I've ever done in my life.

655
46:44.698 --> 46:46.200
Yet, it was the greatest thing I've ever done in my life.

656
46:54.208 --> 46:57.586
When you see a new path, it's okay to try it out.

657
47:00.714 --> 47:02.174
After all, it's your life.

658
47:09.682 --> 47:11.142
Then let's get started.

659
47:13.436 --> 47:14.603
Oh, hot.

660
47:26.449 --> 47:29.368
People sometimes do crazy things in their lives.

661
47:29.452 --> 47:30.536
LOVE AGAIN FOR REMARRYING COUPLES

662
47:30.619 --> 47:32.913
HI, MI-YOUNG WE LIVE IN THE SAME NEIGHBORHOOD

663
47:32.997 --> 47:36.375
Sometimes doing those crazy things revitalizes their lives.

664
47:39.086 --> 47:42.173
It's fine. You're still studying. You wouldn't have money.

665
47:42.256 --> 47:44.467
It's okay. Just trust me.

666
47:45.384 --> 47:47.344
Sometimes it approaches them in the name of love.

667
47:54.518 --> 47:57.771
Sometimes it gives them courage to overcome loneliness.

668
47:59.732 --> 48:02.526
Sometimes it becomes the thrill of starting a new relationship.

669
48:08.240 --> 48:11.452
Sometimes it leaves meaningless hollowness.

670
48:26.550 --> 48:29.428
MY SEUNG-JUN

671
48:29.512 --> 48:30.804
MISSED CALL

672
48:41.774 --> 48:43.234
Seung-jun.

673
48:44.818 --> 48:46.111
SEUNG-JUN

674
48:46.195 --> 48:49.073
LET'S BREAK UP

675
49:01.502 --> 49:04.505
LET'S BREAK UP

676
49:59.977 --> 50:03.230
So, we received a new proposal.

677
50:03.731 --> 50:06.734
It's something we've never done before.

678
50:07.026 --> 50:08.652
So? Aren't you excited?

679
50:08.736 --> 50:10.112
I guarantee you

680
50:10.195 --> 50:12.531
that this will be the most exciting project of the year.

681
50:12.823 --> 50:14.408
Why is she beating around the bush like that?

682
50:14.491 --> 50:15.743
I'm getting a bad feeling about this.

683
50:15.826 --> 50:16.994
Here it is.

684
50:17.995 --> 50:20.372
The new release

685
50:20.456 --> 50:23.208
from the premium adult-products brand, Loand.

686
50:23.292 --> 50:24.293
Dreaming!

687
50:27.630 --> 50:29.590
No way. Really?

688
50:30.424 --> 50:33.594
It's urgent. They want us to start as soon as possible.

689
50:33.886 --> 50:37.306
But what's really crazy is...

690
50:37.765 --> 50:40.309
I wish I could do it.

691
50:40.392 --> 50:42.186
Anyone who wants to be the CEO instead of me?

692
50:43.729 --> 50:47.107
when you can't go any further without going crazy

693
50:47.483 --> 50:50.277
that's when the switch finally turns on at the very edge of the cliff.

694
50:50.361 --> 50:52.571
Anyway, think about it.

695
50:52.655 --> 50:54.406
If you want, you can take one home.

696
50:54.490 --> 50:57.201
I have to go meet my client. I'm off now.

697
50:59.161 --> 51:00.412
I'll do it.

698
51:05.084 --> 51:06.794
Did you just say you'll do it?

699
51:08.462 --> 51:11.090
- Yes. - And as always...

700
51:11.173 --> 51:12.174
I'll give it a shot.

701
51:12.257 --> 51:15.803
My reckless challenge teaches me a valuable lesson.

702
51:45.624 --> 51:46.834
Let me introduce

703
51:46.917 --> 51:50.462
our senior marketer in charge of this project.

704
51:52.047 --> 51:53.841
Hello, I'm Gong Yeon-su.

705
52:07.980 --> 52:09.398
Mr. Dokgo Dal?

706
52:09.982 --> 52:10.983
Ms. Gong Yeon-su?

707
52:11.567 --> 52:14.945
Crazy things should be left to people who have done them before.

708
52:21.535 --> 52:24.663
MAKE ME TINGLE

709
53:06.455 --> 53:08.165
DRIVER'S LICENSE GONG YEON-SU

710
53:14.880 --> 53:19.134
WHERE IS THE HORIZON OF YOUR LIFE?

711
54:46.305 --> 54:48.307
Subtitles by Songmi You
